      "code": "session->server_hostkey = LIBSSH2_ALLOC(session,\n                                                session->server_hostkey_len);",
      "note": "After decoding the untrusted host-key length, the vulnerable code allocates a destination buffer of that size and proceeds toward the copy without any check that the length-prefixed field actually fits in the received reply buffer. The staged patch replaces this manual sequence with `_libssh2_copy_string()` on a bounded `struct string_buf`.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
